outcomeRecord: "---\nslug: project-state-report\nshipped: 2026-09-25\nschemaVersion: 1\n---\n# project-state-report\n\nProject state reporting presents evidence-backed status with unavailable states and bounded safe publication.\nOriginal source decisions, contradictions and verification limits are retained in the linked supplement.\nThis legacy upgrade makes no new execution or live-quality claim.\n\n- outcome: Project state reporting presents evidence-backed status with unavailable states and bounded safe publication.\n- docs: [source supplement](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/project-state-report.md)\n- decisions: [retained decisions](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/project-state-report.md)\n- knowledge: [lessons and constraints](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/project-state-report.md)\n- code: none\n- verification: [historical verification](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/project-state-report.md)\n- followups: [retained limits](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/project-state-report.md), [backlog](.project/pitches/_followups.md)\n- archive: [reviewed recovery record](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/project-state-report.md)\n"
